    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Developers — when they last shipped telemetry",
      "description": "One row per `user`, newest activity first. \"ago\" is relative to now, so anyone who has gone quiet sinks to the bottom of the list. Narrow the time range to ask \"who was active in the last 7 days\" — the range IS the activity filter. Click a user to open the Session Inspector filtered to them.",
